          </xhtml:span>
          <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">
            <xhtml:span style="font-size: 24px;">account 210, the amount of $107,744 related to correcting invoices from March 1, 2022 to September 30, 2024.</xhtml:span>
